# solar-sandbox (SOLAR-SANDBOX-AND-PLANET-PHYSICS-DESIGN.md step 1): the REAL METHOD rows of the shipped entities (EXPECT_HAS proves each row is present in the scratch copy of its meta.pdl, then RUN runs that exact action string the way khtpm_entity.c does: sh -c "<action> '<pkg dir>' '<house>'") through the real mr_transfer_desk.+x on a SCRATCH house. No GUI; entity spawn is skipped because khtpm_entity.+x is absent in scratch.
RESULTS | ../results/solar_sandbox.txt
CASE    | solar-sandbox
SCRATCH |
